I think I'd expect the endianness to be here in a remark(s). Something like

```suggestion
        /// <returns>The hash value for the data already provided.</returns>
        /// <remarks>The return value from this method is the little-endian interpretation of <see cref="GetCurrentHash"/>.</remarks>
```
